This directory holds the cached Sentinel-2 scene used as a raster fallback
(see services/imagery.py). It ships empty in this build.

To populate it, run from an environment with network access to
earth-search.aws.element84.com:

    pip install pystac-client rasterio --break-system-packages
    python3 scripts/fetch_imagery_cache.py

Without a cached scene, the app still runs — the map just won't have a
raster imagery overlay until this file is populated.
